        "description": "Validates that a transaction is includable in the block: checks gas availability, blob gas availability, sender recovery, fee market rules (EIP-1559), blob-specific rules (EIP-4844), SetCode rules (EIP-7702), nonce matching, balance sufficiency, and EOA sender validation.",
