        "description": "Executes a single transaction: validates, deducts gas fees and blob fees from sender, processes the message call via the EVM, applies EIP-7623 calldata floor gas cost, refunds unused gas to sender, transfers priority fees to coinbase, destroys marked accounts, and records receipts.",
